{"channelId":"UCuv63qUg2mmaeVui-XVQ8ag","row":["Shropshire Cat Rescue",505,"Welcome to Shropshire Cat Rescue.\n\nFor 35 years, we've been rescuing and rehoming cats across Shropshire. We're a volunteer-run shelter caring for cats and kittens who need somewhere safe to recover, receive care and, where possible, find a suitable forever home.\n\nHere you'll find the cats behind the rescue: their stories, personalities, progress and journeys to new homes, alongside behind-the-scenes content from life at the shelter.\n\nWe'll also share practical cat advice, educational content, fundraising appeals and a look at the people and work that keep the rescue running.\n\nFollow the cats, meet the people behind their care and discover more about the work that happens every day at Shropshire Cat Rescue.\n\nSubscribe, Sponsor and donate to support our work ↓","sponsorship@shropshirecatrescue.org.uk; info@shropshirecatrescue.org.uk; donation@shropshirecatrescue.org.uk; Emaildonation@shropshirecatrescue.org.uk","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuv63qUg2mmaeVui-XVQ8ag","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuv63qUg2mmaeVui-XVQ8ag","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:59.260Z","channelId":"UCuv63qUg2mmaeVui-XVQ8ag","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e3e826f8cb55ee35f38fa90a0b17ff31993d33904c06a56d1096797419bee8f4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"9247379f8d7f23a62cfef3f71d3f0b20e5675c18a43799055bddc87eefbd8b59"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuv63qUg2mmaeVui-XVQ8ag","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:59.260Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuv63qUg2mmaeVui-XVQ8ag","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":505,"raw":"505 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuv63qUg2mmaeVui-XVQ8ag","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:59.260Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"sponsorship@shropshirecatrescue.org.uk","purp